    skos:editorialNote "Curated classification (group=grp_natural_dyestuffs; processing_state=unspecified; land_basis=mineral): Mineral pigments (iron-oxide ochres; zinc white) belong with Painters' Colours and Pigments, not smelted metals. Layer-1 observations: 24 rows, 1812–1901. Series: CSP_Canadian Trade and Navigation ×5; KEW_CUST 4 ×4; CSP_Canadian_Exports_BlankSeries (inferred, series not printed) ×14. Units: Lbs. (Pounds) ×19; Hundredweights.Quarters.Pounds ×4; Casks ×1. Top routes: Canada → United States ×4; Canada → All Countries ×3; Quebec → All Countries ×3; Canada → England ×2."@en ;
